From 7c79d8212f3e7fd85e63dcdea1932f829157bf3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AkiraZheng <1428384878@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 20:24:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] KVM: arm64: Enable HDBSS support and handle HDBSSF events

Add HDBSS buffer management functions:
- kvm_arm_vcpu_free_hdbss: Free HDBSS buffer pages
- kvm_cap_arm_enable_hdbss: Enable/disable HDBSS via ioctl
- kvm_flush_hdbss_buffer: Flush dirty pages from HDBSS buffer
- kvm_handle_hdbss_fault: Handle HDBSS fault events
- __load_hdbss: Load HDBSS registers on VCPU entry

Add HDBSS fields to kvm_arch and kvm_vcpu_arch structures.
Add KVM_REQ_FLUSH_HDBSS request for buffer flush handling.
Add DBM attribute setting in user_mem_abort for dirty tracking.

Handle HDBSSF (ISS2 bit 11) in guest abort handler to process
dirty tracking events.
